---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="kicker">TROi</p>
    <h1>Practice creates insight. Insight develops perspective. Perspective improves practice.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I work as an independent consultant helping organizations improve how they create value through
      technology, architecture and organizational design — see <a href="/about/#what-i-offer">what I offer</a>.
      Over time that work evolved into an ongoing body of thought I call Organizational Flow.
    </p>
    <div class="horizon"></div>
  </section>

  <main class="reading" id="main">
    <section class="block">
      <p>
        The blog captures observations from that work as they happen. <a href="/organizational-flow/">Organizational Flow</a> develops those observations into a coherent perspective — an evolving answer to how organizations create value.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
